      "text": "\n\n## Trip highlights\n\nExplore the city’s history, take a sunset river trip in search of pink dolphins, and head into the jungle for hikes and night tours. The itinerary also features kayaking, wildlife and birdwatching, river rapids, Maroon villages, old plantations and mangrove forests.\n"
